{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore erased worlds, piece by piece</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Patchventure</strong>, most of the  map is gone. Each time you find a <strong>map fragment</strong>, you choose how it connects to the one you\u2019re in. Your goal? Beat the boss ruling that map to bring back peace. Defeat it, move to a new map, and keep going until the whole world is restored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your power with risky choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s the twist: as the world changes, so do you. Every <strong>fragment</strong> you pick adds <strong>perks</strong> and <strong>downsides</strong> that stack over time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a <strong>small forest fragment</strong>: deal <strong>2\u00d7 more</strong> damage, but also take <strong>2\u00d7 more</strong> damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a <strong>mountain fragment</strong>: find more <strong>loot</strong> and <strong>events</strong> nearby, but enemies <strong>double</strong> around that area.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path, your build, your run. Each choice pushes <strong>replayability</strong> way up\u2014no two runs should feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare your expedition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across your journey, you\u2019ll find <strong>artifacts</strong> from quests, shops, bosses, and chests. Before a new run, equip one to shape your <strong>play style</strong>. And you won\u2019t be alone\u2014you\u2019ll meet <strong>folks</strong> along the way who might join your expedition too\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll keep this page updated as development goes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this sounds up your alley, <strong>Wishlist Patchventure</strong> to follow the journey and catch updates as soon as they drop.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3644180?t=1768053260","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644180/bb4023a76ff483d52a32bc3119297d0e36b234ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768053260","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644180/6c904fff15fd25ed828d9ea31bba1118754ccf49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768053260","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644180/6c904fff15fd25ed828d9ea31bba1118754ccf49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768053260","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore erased worlds, piece by piece</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Patchventure</strong>, most of the  map is gone. Each time you find a <strong>map fragment</strong>, you choose how it connects to the one you\u2019re in. Your goal? Beat the boss ruling that map to bring back peace. Defeat it, move to a new map, and keep going until the whole world is restored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your power with risky choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here\u2019s the twist: as the world changes, so do you. Every <strong>fragment</strong> you pick adds <strong>perks</strong> and <strong>downsides</strong> that stack over time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a <strong>small forest fragment</strong>: deal <strong>2\u00d7 more</strong> damage, but also take <strong>2\u00d7 more</strong> damage.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a <strong>mountain fragment</strong>: find more <strong>loot</strong> and <strong>events</strong> nearby, but enemies <strong>double</strong> around that area.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path, your build, your run. Each choice pushes <strong>replayability</strong> way up\u2014no two runs should feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare your expedition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across your journey, you\u2019ll find <strong>artifacts</strong> from quests, shops, bosses, and chests. Before a new run, equip one to shape your <strong>play style</strong>. And you won\u2019t be alone\u2014you\u2019ll meet <strong>folks</strong> along the way who might join your expedition too\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll keep this page updated as development goes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If this sounds up your alley, <strong>Wishlist Patchventure</strong> to follow the journey and catch updates as soon as they drop.</p>","developers":["Everbro Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644180/a6f05a1d4bcfb28daca2bf2a569bab47fb5b037f/header.jpg?t=1768053260","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Patchventure","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-5200U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 950M<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stron