19da2f73600db881a2164b/ss_c39895a6d7b88269ff19da2f73600db881a2164b.600x338.jpg?t=1768053260"}],"short_description":"Piece the world back together. In Patchventure, connect map fragments to shape your path, take bold risk-reward perks, and face world-ruling bosses. Equip artifacts, recruit allies, and push for peace\u2014each run plays differently.","steam_appid":3644180,"support_info":{"email":"everbro.studio@gmail.com","url":"https://www.everbro-studio.com"},"supported_languages":"English, French","type":"game","website":"https://www.everbro-studio.com/"}